1
00:00:01,420 --> 00:00:10,020
Hang Trong Paintings

2
00:00:10,820 --> 00:00:29,000
Since childhood, I have loved paintings of pigs, chickens, mice, frogs, coconut tree paintings, beauty paintings of Hang Trong.

3
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:41,050
Hang Trong painting technique has reached sophistication:

4
00:00:41,050 --> 00:00:58,350
beauty paintings in colored shirts, flower pants on black background - a very Vietnamese black color.

5
00:00:58,550 --> 00:01:11,470
Black color is refined from charcoal powder reminding of countryside homeland:

6
00:01:11,470 --> 00:01:28,950
kitchen straw ash, charcoal of kerosene lamp and charcoal of fallen autumn leaves.

7
00:01:29,550 --> 00:01:44,050
The white powder also is a creativity contributing to the nation's color treasure in painting.

8
00:01:44,950 --> 00:01:52,200
That white color is more pleasing the more you look at;

9
00:01:52,200 --> 00:02:07,400
thousands of shimmering white powder grains add mystery to faces,

10
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:21,320
add liveliness to figures in paintings.

